-- Adds the parts of the official CAAI drone restriction map (Information-pages
-- Drones restricted airspace, weekdays+weekends KMZ) that aip_reference_zones
-- was missing. Compared layer by layer against production on 2026-10-03:
--   * "הגבלות בסיסי חיל אוויר" (48 overlapping circles/rectangles around 8 air
--     force bases) left real gaps outside the CTR/ATZ polygons already loaded
--     (e.g. east of Hatzor, north of Palmachim, around Tel Nof, Ovda) --
--     dissolved here into one polygon per base.
--   * 6 of the 35 "אזורים אסורים לטיסת כטב\"ם קטן" polygons had no counterpart
--     (two nature reserves + the four offshore "shushan" areas).
-- Inserted as kind PROHIBITED because that is how flight-rules.ts already
-- treats a ground-based area where small-UAS flight is banned outright.
-- Idempotent: re-running replaces only rows carrying this source tag.
delete from aip_reference_zones where source_sheet = 'caai_drone_map_2026_09';

